  "prefLabel": "Rev 803.03 Stating Exemption Claimed on the Deed",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 803.03 Stating Exemption Claimed on the Deed. Any instrument to be recorded transferring real estate, or an interest in real estate, for which an exemption, pursuant to RSA 78-B, is claimed shall state the basis for the exemption.\n\nSource. #8579, eff 3-08-06; ss by #10665, eff 9-9-14; ss by 14071, eff 9-10-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev800.html"
